      "body": "Please see [this article](http://www.mattzeunert.com/2016/03/17/devtools-never-pause-here.html) for context. This feature is very useful when you want to use \"Pause on all exceptions\" and then ignore the caught errors that you're not interested in.\r\n\r\n`vscode v1.29.1`",
